    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.000" end="00:01.500" ttm:agent="v1">[中原めいこ:]</p>
      <p begin="00:00.013" end="00:03.411" ttm:agent="v1">今日はコンチで決めて</p>
      <p begin="00:03.411" end="00:08.090" ttm:agent="v1">ネクタイ ラフな着こなし</p>
      <p begin="00:08.090" end="00:12.282" ttm:agent="v1">くわえ煙草で はしゃいでるけど</p>
      <p begin="00:12.282" end="00:15.052" ttm:agent="v1">アナタ 誰を見てるの</p>
      <p begin="00:15.052" end="00:17.597" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">($upreme, you're a b**ch)</p>
      <p begin="00:17.597" end="00:19.097" ttm:agent="v1">[lilbubblegum:]</p>
      <p begin="00:18.747" end="00:20.799" ttm:agent="v1">I need you back, girl, you got me in my feelings</p>
      <p begin="00:20.799" end="00:22.836" ttm:agent="v1">Heart so cold, man, I think lil' shawty stealing</p>
      <p begin="00:22.836" end="00:24.866" ttm:agent="v1">On my Marvin Gaye sh*t, I really need sexual healing</p>
      <p begin="00:24.866" end="00:27.121" ttm:agent="v1">That b**ch wanna slide through, red dress, it's appealing</p>
      <p begin="00:27.121" end="00:29.125" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, just take it off, I ain't f**k with no thot</p>
      <p begin="00:29.125" end="00:31.572" ttm:agent="v1">You know it's cuffin' season, I ain't no cop</p>
      <p begin="00:31.572" end="00:33.531" ttm:agent="v1">Opps wanna plot 'cause I'm climbin' to the top</p>
      <p begin="00:33.531" end="00:35.856" ttm:agent="v1">They see that I planted crops, now some millies on my drops</p>
      <p begin="00:35.856" end="00:37.985" ttm:agent="v1">I need you back, girl, you got me in my feelings</p>
      <p begin="00:37.985" end="00:39.945" ttm:agent="v1">Heart so cold, man, I think lil' shawty stealing</p>
      <p begin="00:39.945" end="00:41.954" ttm:agent="v1">On my Marvin Gaye sh*t, I really need sexual healing</p>
      <p begin="00:41.954" end="00:44.263" ttm:agent="v1">That b**ch wanna slide through, red dress, it's appealing</p>
      <p begin="00:44.263" end="00:46.260" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, just take it off, I ain't f**k with no thot</p>
      <p begin="00:46.260" end="00:48.755" ttm:agent="v1">You know it's cuffin' season, I ain't no cop</p>
      <p begin="00:48.755" end="00:50.600" ttm:agent="v1">Opps wanna plot 'cause I'm climbin' to the top</p>
      <p begin="00:50.600" end="00:52.689" ttm:agent="v1">They see that I planted crops, now some millies on my drops</p>
      <p begin="00:52.689" end="00:54.189" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:52.804" end="00:54.304" ttm:agent="v1">[Ciscaux:]</p>
      <p begin="00:52.952" end="00:55.760" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, said you more than my b**ch, you my shawty, you my bestfriend</p>
      <p begin="00:55.760" end="00:57.815" ttm:agent="v1">Know they plottin' on me so I gotta keep an FN</p>
      <p begin="00:57.815" end="01:00.001" ttm:agent="v1">East side boy, but I met her in the west ends</p>
      <p begin="01:00.001" end="01:02.236" ttm:agent="v1">She send love, all my opps send death threats</p>
      <p begin="01:02.236" end="01:04.134" ttm:agent="v1">I don't know why they wishin' death on my name</p>
      <p begin="01:04.134" end="01:06.249" ttm:agent="v1">This a new droptop and I'm switchin' through all the lanes</p>
      <p begin="01:06.249" end="01:08.368" ttm:agent="v1">Got a new crop top just to compliment all her rings</p>
      <p begin="01:08.368" end="01:10.557" ttm:agent="v1">And I can't hotbox 'cause the smoke it gets blown away, like</p>
      <p begin="01:10.557" end="01:12.877" ttm:agent="v1">She hit me up like, &quot;What the f**k?&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:12.877" end="01:14.994" ttm:agent="v1">&quot;Who you with and who that was?&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:14.994" end="01:17.059" ttm:agent="v1">Sorry, girl, I cannot trust</p>
      <p begin="01:17.059" end="01:19.128" ttm:agent="v1">Or not focus on double cups</p>
      <p begin="01:19.128" end="01:21.198" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause like, everything I'm sipping it's f**kin' up all my vision</p>
      <p begin="01:21.198" end="01:23.148" ttm:agent="v1">It's got me just reminiscin' about all the times I'd visit</p>
      <p begin="01:23.148" end="01:26.702" ttm:agent="v1">And everything I ever did, I'd trade it for a single kiss</p>
      <p begin="01:26.702" end="01:28.202" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:27.257" end="01:28.757" ttm:agent="v1">[lilbubblegum:]</p>
      <p begin="01:27.406" end="01:29.352" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">No 1nonly, b**ch, go ahead and dance (b**ch)</p>
      <p begin="01:29.352" end="01:31.354" ttm:agent="v1">She gon' do what I say, she a thot and she a fan</p>
      <p begin="01:31.354" end="01:33.347" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I don't really give a f**k about a ho 'cause I got bands (Nah, nah)</p>
      <p begin="01:33.347" end="01:35.673" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Yeah, this money on my mind 'cause I need it to advance (Band, band, bands)</p>
      <p begin="01:35.673" end="01:37.903" ttm:agent="v1">Get that sloppy 'cause I'm poppin' inside her mouth just like rocks</p>
      <p begin="01:37.903" end="01:39.930" ttm:agent="v1">Shawty top me, I got Ruby's, I ain't talkin' on my block</p>
      <p begin="01:39.930" end="01:42.001" ttm:agent="v1">Two Glocks, hoes flock, 10K new watch</p>
      <p begin="01:42.001" end="01:43.804" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">AP, my G iced out, still hot (Nah, nah)</p>
      <p begin="01:43.804" end="01:45.937" ttm:agent="v1">b**ch, we hot, it's a motherf**kin' sauna</p>
      <p begin="01:45.937" end="01:47.437" ttm:agent="v1">We shooting movies like Warner</p>
      <p begin="01:47.013" end="01:49.315" ttm:agent="v1">Slide through, my coupe, man, lil' shawty tight, anaconda</p>
      <p begin="01:49.315" end="01:51.341" ttm:agent="v1">She said period, but you know that I'm focused up on the commas</p>
      <p begin="01:51.341" end="01:53.446" ttm:agent="v1">I be switching' hoes, they need me though the way I'm changin' genres</p>
      <p begin="01:53.446" end="01:55.651" ttm:agent="v1">All the sauce, we did this, mind your business</p>
      <p begin="01:55.651" end="01:57.782" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Copy, paste, man, what is this sh*t? (What the f**k?)</p>
      <p begin="01:57.782" end="01:59.989" ttm:agent="v1">Way too cold, we caught some sickness</p>
